          <unicode>ᠠᠷᠠᠰᠤᠨ ᠲᠡᠭᠦᠯ ᠢ ᠨᠡᠮᠦᠷᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <definition>endosser un habit de cuir</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
